{"id":490,"title":"记忆化-斐波那契数","summary":"在这一课中，我们将使用记忆化的动态编程技术来降低纯递归的斐波那契代码的时间复杂度。\n","tags":"","components":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"85462c4d-522d-45bc-8dab-f15be04d9bc8","text":"在上一课中，我们介绍了动态规划的基本概念和它的两种编程模式：记忆化和表格化。\n\n在本章第一课中，我们确定了斐波那契数列的递归实现会导致子问题的重复计算，从而导致指数级的时间复杂度。\n\n现在让我们把之前实现的经典递归代码**记忆化**，看看它能把时间复杂度降低到什么水平。基本的想法是，在计算之前，检查是否已经计算过第`n`个斐波那契数。\n\n## 记忆化代码\n\n请看一下Python中的完整代码：","text_html":"<p>在上一课中，我们介绍了动态规划的基本概念和它的两种编程模式：记忆化和表格化。</p>\n<p>在本章第一课中，我们确定了斐波那契数列的递归实现会导致子问题的重复计算，从而导致指数级的时间复杂度。</p>\n<p>现在让我们把之前实现的经典递归代码<strong>记忆化</strong>，看看它能把时间复杂度降低到什么水平。基本的想法是，在计算之前，检查是否已经计算过第<code>n</code>个斐波那契数。</p>\n<h2>记忆化代码</h2>\n<p>请看一下Python中的完整代码：</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":0},{"type":"TabbedCode","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"b19899a9-81e5-416b-8a4b-eeeddf973771","caption":"","code_contents":[{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"tab_code_0_b19899a9-81e5-416b-8a4b-eeeddf973771","title":"Fibonacci_Number","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"def fib(num, lookup_table):\n  \"\"\"\n  Finds nth fibonacci number\n  :param num: An integer number\n  :param lookup_table: Stores already calculated fibonacci number\n  :return: nth fibonacci number\n  \"\"\"\n  if lookup_table[num] == -1: # Check if already present\n    \n    # Adding entry to table when not present\n    if num <= 1:\n      lookup_table[num] = num\n    else:\n      lookup_table[num] = fib(num - 1, lookup_table) + fib(num - 2, lookup_table)\n\n  return lookup_table[num]\n\n# Driver code to test above function\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n  num = 6  # Finding the nth Fibonacci number \n  lookup_table = [-1] * (num + 1)  # Initializing the lookup table to have -1 of size num + 1\n  print(fib(num, lookup_table))","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"16\n14","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null}],"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"dfa4262a-d382-477b-acd5-318dd9265637","text":"代码非常简单，输入参数为:\n\n* 数字`num`，代表我们想找到的第几个斐波那契数--在例子中是$6$。\n\n* 变量`lookup_table`查找表，大小为$n+1$，初始化为$-1$。\n\n然后：\n\n* 在函数`fib`检查该值是否已经存在于表中，如果是，则返回该值，如**第16行**。\n\n* 如果该值不存在，那么继续递归计算（如**第14行**）。\n\n## 时间复杂度的提高\n\n下面的插图显示了如何使用记忆化技术减少递归调用：","text_html":"<p>代码非常简单，输入参数为:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>数字<code>num</code>，代表我们想找到的第几个斐波那契数–在例子中是<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">6</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>变量<code>lookup_table</code>查找表，大小为<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.72777em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span></span></span></span>，初始化为<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.72777em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>然后：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>在函数<code>fib</code>检查该值是否已经存在于表中，如果是，则返回该值，如<strong>第16行</strong>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>如果该值不存在，那么继续递归计算（如<strong>第14行</strong>）。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>时间复杂度的提高</h2>\n<p>下面的插图显示了如何使用记忆化技术减少递归调用：</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":2},{"type":"BinaryTree","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"52223877-c9b8-4f2f-9a23-fd2a7e925511","caption":"","file":"/content/assets/fd08df35d379310e36bc.svg","svg_string":"<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\" standalone=\"no\"?>\n<!DOCTYPE svg PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD SVG 1.1//EN\"\n \"http://www.w3.org/Graphics/SVG/1.1/DTD/svg11.dtd\">\n<!-- Generated by graphviz version 2.40.1 (20161225.0304)\n -->\n<!-- Title: %0 Pages: 1 -->\n<svg width=\"392pt\" height=\"368pt\"\n viewBox=\"0.00 0.00 392.19 368.00\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<g id=\"graph0\" class=\"graph\" transform=\"scale(1 1) rotate(0) translate(4 364)\">\n<title>%0</title>\n<!-- node_1 -->\n<g id=\"node_1\" class=\"node\">\n<title>node_1</title>\n<path fill=\"#e13a55\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\".5\" d=\"M259.6667,-330.5C259.6667,-330.5 323.5221,-330.5 323.5221,-330.5 328.3555,-330.5 333.1888,-335.3333 333.1888,-340.1667 333.1888,-340.1667 333.1888,-349.8333 333.1888,-349.8333 333.1888,-354.6667 328.3555,-359.5 323.5221,-359.5 323.5221,-359.5 259.6667,-359.5 259.6667,-359.5 254.8333,-359.5 250,-354.6667 250,-349.8333 250,-349.8333 250,-340.1667 250,-340.1667 250,-335.3333 254.8333,-330.5 259.6667,-330.5\"/>\n<text text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"291.5944\" y=\"-340.2\" font-family=\"Courier,monospace\" font-size=\"16.00\" fill=\"#000000\">fib (6)</text>\n</g>\n<!-- node_2 -->\n<g id=\"node_2\" class=\"node\">\n<title>node_2</title